HST Office: F1, the Help menu and the Help buttons of dialogs open the offline Vietnamese
user guide instead of a web page.

The guide (help/index.html) ships inside the bundled HST extension hst-vietnamese-tools,
which is unpacked into <install>/share/extensions on every platform. Office.Common/Help/
HelpRootURL defaults to vnd.sun.star.expand:$BUNDLED_EXTENSIONS/hst-vietnamese-tools/help/
index.html; impl_showOnlineHelp (and the tip-of-the-day "more" link, see hst-debrand.patch)
expand that macro URL to a file URL before handing it to the system browser. Any other value,
for example an https page, is used unchanged, so pointing HelpRootURL at a web page later
needs only a configuration change. Applies after hst-debrand.patch.

License: modified upstream files keep their license (MPL-2.0).
